  "description": "*“What a high-maintenance prince, huh?”*\n\nDo Ha-Jae, who lives as a lion to atone for the karma of lives he took with his own hands after becoming a demon. From Yama, he received the task of protecting Hyeon Ju-Min and safely retrieving his soul once he completes his remaining life. The period is 99 days, the price is lost memories and reincarnation. To fulfill this, he began a relationship with Hyeon Jun-Min, his guest, neighbor, and school senior, who lives a life of misfortune. Yet somehow, it feels like there's something more defining their connection.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
